  "question": {
    "text": "The solution of the differential equation <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mrow><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is (where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi></math> is an arbitrary constant)",
